  "portfolioPrompt": "I just built a Contract Clause Extractor: it reads PDF or DOCX contracts, uses an AI gateway to extract 15 standard clause types with exact quotes and plain-English summaries, verifies every quote against the actual source text before trusting it, assigns each clause a red/yellow/green risk rating against a fixed rubric, rolls those up into an overall contract risk score, flags deviations from a standard clause library, and can compare two contract versions to highlight material differences. Output exports to a formatted Word document.\n\nHelp me write:\n1. A 3-4 sentence portfolio project description focused on the business impact (faster contract review, consistent risk flagging)\n2. A LinkedIn post (under 150 words) announcing the project, written for a legal-tech or B2B SaaS audience\n3. Two resume bullet points quantifying the time-saving potential"
